{
  "id": "28120_katarikakeru",
  "headword": "{語|かた}りかける",
  "reading": "かたりかける",
  "romaji": "katarikakeru",
  "part_of_speech": "verb (ichidan)",
  "gloss": "to speak to; to address; to talk to",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "to speak to; to address (someone)",
      "explanation": "To speak to someone, often gently or warmly and in a way that invites a response. Also used of works of art or media that 'speak to' the audience emotionally."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "28120_katarikakeru_ex1",
      "japanese": "{子|こ}どもに{優|やさ}しく{語|かた}りかける。",
      "english": "I speak gently to the child.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28120_katarikakeru_ex2",
      "japanese": "{彼女|かのじょ}は{赤|あか}ちゃんに{語|かた}りかけた。",
      "english": "She talked to the baby.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "28120_katarikakeru_ex3",
      "japanese": "この{映画|えいが}は、{観|み}る{人|ひと}の{心|こころ}に{静|しず}かに{語|かた}りかけてくる。",
      "english": "This film speaks quietly to the heart of the viewer.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "{語|かた}りかける is a compound verb ({語|かた}る + かける) meaning to speak to or address someone, usually with warmth or care. The listener is marked with に. The かける ending adds the sense of an action directed outward toward someone.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {優|やさ}しく{語|かた}りかける: to speak gently to\n- {心|こころ}に{語|かた}りかける: to speak to the heart (move emotionally)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {話|はな}しかける: to speak to; to strike up a conversation — more neutral and everyday\n- {語|かた}る: to tell; to narrate — to recount or relate at length",
